        "original_id": "15a98534-1d83-5652-a635-fb77924cb70b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Topics: The New York Times Fiction Best Sellers of 2017\n- Products: Camino Island, The Shack\n- People: John Grisham, William P. Young\n- Organizations: The New York Times\n\nFacts:\n- The Shack is a novel by Canadian author William P. Young that was published in 2007.\n- The New York Times Fiction Best Sellers of 2017 page lists adult fiction books that topped The New York Times Fiction Best Seller list in 2017 in the Combined Print & E-Book Fiction category.\n- In 2017, Camino Island by John Grisham was so far the most frequent weekly best seller on The New York Times Fiction Best Seller list with 5 weeks at number one.\n- In 2017, The Shack by William P. Young followed with 4 weeks at the top of The New York Times Fiction Best Seller list.",
